`;

exports[`github.main-review.census given: [case3] an owner with one repo of each shape when: [t0] the census runs then: rows.tsv carries the perm and basis the table drops, and matches snapshot 1`] = `
"acme/no-main	no	unknown	no main branch	WRITE	none
acme/bare	yes	lacks	main unprotected	WRITE	certain
acme/ruled	yes	requires	ruleset: 2 approvals	WRITE	certain
acme/admin-gated	yes	requires	protection: 1 approval	ADMIN	certain
acme/admin-open	no	lacks	protection: 0 approvals	ADMIN	certain
acme/push-gated	yes	requires	pr #12 reviewDecision=REVIEW_REQUIRED	WRITE	inferred
acme/push-open	yes	lacks	pr #7 reviewDecision=(empty)	WRITE	inferred
acme/push-undecided	no	unknown	protected; no decisive pr in the latest 10	WRITE	none
"
`;

exports[`github.main-review.census given: [case3] an owner with one repo of each shape when: [t0] the census runs then: stdout matches snapshot 1`] = `
"🐢 heres the wave...

🐚 github.main-review.census --owners 'acme'
   ├─ mode: read only
   ├─ owners
   │  ├─ acme: 10 repos listed
   │  └─ done
   │
   ├─ repos read: 8 (skipped 2 archived or forked)
   ├─ verdicts
   │  ├─ requires: 3 (2 certain, 1 inferred)
   │  ├─ lacks: 3 (2 certain, 1 inferred; 2 with a release workflow)
   │  └─ unknown: 2
   └─ landed, at paths from the repo root
      ├─ table: .log/github.main-review.census/census.md
      └─ rows: .log/github.main-review.census/rows.tsv (each repo, with its perm and basis)

🐢 righteous! census done
"
`;

exports[`github.main-review.census given: [case3] an owner with one repo of each shape when: [t0] the census runs then: the table matches snapshot 1`] = `
"| repo | release workflow | review gate on main | signal |
|------|------------------|---------------------|--------|
| acme/admin-open | no | lacks | protection: 0 approvals |
| acme/bare | yes | lacks | main unprotected |
| acme/push-open | yes | lacks | pr #7 reviewDecision=(empty) |
| acme/admin-gated | yes | requires | protection: 1 approval |
| acme/push-gated | yes | requires | pr #12 reviewDecision=REVIEW_REQUIRED |
| acme/ruled | yes | requires | ruleset: 2 approvals |
| acme/no-main | no | unknown | no main branch |
| acme/push-undecided | no | unknown | protected; no decisive pr in the latest 10 |
"
`;

